{"id": "DfR_5RsRB3p", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Ram ki sena ke vanar asal mein devtaon ke bete the. Kaun kiska putra? Video mein poori list. Follow karo agle part ke liye.\n\nValmiki Ramayan, Baal Kaand. Raavan ko vardaan tha ki koi devta, daanav ya yaksh use maar nahi sakta. Insaan ko usne gina hi nahi, isliye Vishnu Ram bankar aaye.\n\nTab Brahma ne devtaon se kaha, Vishnu ki sahayata ke liye apne jaise balwan putra vanar roop mein paida karo.\n\nIndra se Bali, Surya se Sugriva, Vayu se Hanuman, Agni se Neel, Vishwakarma se Nal, Brihaspati se Taar, aur Ashwini Kumaron se Mainda aur Dvivida. Jambavan pehle hi Brahma ki jamhai se paida ho chuke the.\n\nMainda aur Dvivida Mahabharat ke yug mein bhi dikhe. Ek Pandav unse lada. Kaun? Agle episode mein.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Episode 6.\n\n#ramayan #hanuman #vanarsena #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793712874, "like_count": 1607, "comment_count": 6, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4094394087534496a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.45, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN6BEspZwkq157eR_MfKi1zXHqvWEnm21y_IUaqNCAASaZtbbOArZOAM7REUFaRASjZFdTcRszhw_gg81leIowQnHAa35df9Gk5T_w.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqCbFhNJV-JKD3rNRQMkWNQeOXteiTFOjfdbsc5h2p-hEi4i4oKsoJ5fELKF09HX8ZMw-09Wye9vt2PEnP7q3iD&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=d7lna-Etex8Q7kNvwE6srwj&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=wyRcFfS-a9Me6ff_CrvNlw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketles